eneral/las-mejores-playas-para-visitar-en-la-costa-del-sol/\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/general-information/best-beaches-to-visit-in-the-costa-del-sol/\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/es/informacion-general/las-mejores-playas-para-visitar-en-la-costa-del-sol/\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/fbrfg/favicon-48x48.png\" sizes=\"48x48\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/fbrfg/favicon.svg\">\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/fbrfg/favicon.ico\">\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/fbrfg/apple-touch-icon.png\">\n<meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-title\" content=\"PropertyList\">\n<link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/fbrfg/site.webmanifest\">\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<link rel=\"pingback\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/xmlrpc.php\"><meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Elementor 3.27.3; features: e_font_icon_svg, additional_custom_breakpoints; settings: css_print_method-external, google_font-enabled, font_display-swap\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"//code.tidio.co\">\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"WP Super Duper v1.2.17\" data-sd-source=\"userswp\"><meta name=\"generator\" content=\"WP Font Awesome Settings v1.1.7\" data-ac-source=\"userswp\">    \n\n    \n\n\t\n\t\t<!-- Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n<noscript></noscript>\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n\t\t\n        \n\n\n\n        <div class=\"body_wrapper \">\n            <div class=\"click_capture\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"side_menu  menu_purple\"><div class=\"mobile_nav_wrapper\"><h1><span style=\"color: rgb(11, 18, 32); font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;\">Best beaches to visit in the Costa del Sol.</span></h1></div></div><section class=\"tip_banner_area\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-9 m-auto\">                    <div class=\"single_post_author d-flex justify-content-center\">\n        <div class=\"text post_tag\">\n                            <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/2024/08/05/\" class=\"meta-item date\">\n                    <ion-icon name=\"calendar-outline\"></ion-icon>\n                    August 5, 2024                </a>\n                                <div class=\"meta-item read-time\" title=\"4 minutes to read this post\"><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"blog_area tip_doc_area\" id=\"sticky_doc2\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-8 blog_single_info\"><div class=\"main-post \"><div class=\"blog_single_item editor-content\"><div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9430\" class=\"elementor elementor-9430\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4c29f0ae e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4c29f0ae\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-51127d1c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"51127d1c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p></p>\n<p><strong>Costa del Sol: A Journey Through Paradise</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>The Costa del Sol, also known as the Sunshine Coast, is a dazzling stretch of coastline along southern Spain, renowned for its pristine beaches, charming towns, and vibrant cultural attractions. From the bustling city of Málaga to the picturesque whitewashed villages, the region offers an enticing blend of relaxation and adventure.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>1. Nerja – Playa de Burriana: A Paradise of Golden Sands</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-10597 alignnone lazyload\" data-src=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/arc_194213_g.jpg\" alt=\"Nerja – Playa de Burriana\" width=\"141\" height=\"91\" data-srcset=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/arc_194213_g.jpg 700w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/arc_194213_g-300x193.jpg 300w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/arc_194213_g-20x13.jpg 20w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/arc_194213_g-32x21.jpg 32w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/arc_194213_g-60x40.jpg 60w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 141px) 100vw, 141px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 141px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 141/91;\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Located in the vibrant town of Nerja, Playa de Burriana is a vast expanse of golden sand, stretching for over 1,500 meters. This popular beach is renowned for its crystal-clear waters, gentle waves, and well-maintained facilities, making it an ideal destination for families and sunseekers alike.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>2. Malaga – Playa de la Malagueta: Urban Oasis in the Heart of Málaga</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"></figure>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10614 lazyload\" data-src=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/la-malagueta1.jpg\" alt=\"Malaga – Playa de la Malagueta\" width=\"430\" height=\"344\" data-srcset=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/la-malagueta1.jpg 430w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/la-malagueta1-300x240.jpg 300w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/la-malagueta1-20x16.jpg 20w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/la-malagueta1-32x26.jpg 32w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 100vw, 430px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 430px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 430/344;\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Just steps from the historic centre of Málaga, Playa de la Malagueta offers the perfect blend of city convenience and seaside tranquillity. This urban oasis boasts a lively promenade lined with cafes, restaurants, and shops, providing ample opportunities to soak in the vibrant atmosphere.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>3. Fuengirola – Playa de los Boliches: A Family-Friendly Haven</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10615 lazyload\" data-src=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/0000029.jpg\" alt=\"Fuengirola – Playa de los Boliches\" width=\"690\" height=\"541\" data-srcset=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/0000029.jpg 690w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/0000029-300x235.jpg 300w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/0000029-20x16.jpg 20w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/0000029-32x25.jpg 32w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 690px) 100vw, 690px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 690px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 690/541;\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Playa de los Boliches is a haven for families in the bustling town of Fuengirola. This wide, sandy beach is gently sloped, making it safe for children to play, and its calm waters are ideal for swimming and water sports. The beach is also well-equipped with amenities, including playgrounds, showers, and sun loungers.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>4. Cabopino – Playa de Artola: A Natural Beauty</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10616 lazyload\" data-src=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/784181916_235165284_1024x576.webp\" alt=\"Cabopino – Playa de Artola\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" data-srcset=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/784181916_235165284_1024x576.webp 1024w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/784181916_235165284_1024x576-300x169.webp 300w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/784181916_235165284_1024x576-768x432.webp 768w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/784181916_235165284_1024x576-20x11.webp 20w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/784181916_235165284_1024x576-32x18.webp 32w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/784181916_235165284_1024x576-270x152.webp 270w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024/576;\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Nestled within the protected Artola Dunes Natural Park, Playa de Artola is a sanctuary of natural beauty. This unspoiled stretch of sand is fringed by lush vegetation and offers a tranquil escape from the crowds. With its shallow waters and gentle waves, it’s a perfect spot for families and nature enthusiasts.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>5. Estepona – Playa de la Rada: A Charm of Old-World Elegance</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10617 lazyload\" data-src=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Playa_de_la_Rada_-_Estepona_Garden_of_the_Costa_del_Sol.jpg\" alt=\"Estepona – Playa de la Rada:\" width=\"1200\" height=\"720\" data-srcset=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Playa_de_la_Rada_-_Estepona_Garden_of_the_Costa_del_Sol.jpg 1200w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Playa_de_la_Rada_-_Estepona_Garden_of_the_Costa_del_Sol-300x180.jpg 300w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Playa_de_la_Rada_-_Estepona_Garden_of_the_Costa_del_Sol-1024x614.jpg 1024w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Playa_de_la_Rada_-_Estepona_Garden_of_the_Costa_del_Sol-768x461.jpg 768w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Playa_de_la_Rada_-_Estepona_Garden_of_the_Costa_del_Sol-20x12.jpg 20w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Playa_de_la_Rada_-_Estepona_Garden_of_the_Costa_del_Sol-32x19.jpg 32w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1200px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1200/720;\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Playa de la Rada is the heart of Estepona’s seafront promenade, offering a harmonious blend of traditional charm and modern amenities. This sandy beach, lined with palm trees and colourful chiringuitos (beach bars), exudes an old-world elegance that has captivated visitors for generations.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>6. San Roque – Playa de Sotogrande: A Luxurious Retreat<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10619 lazyload\" data-src=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/alcaidesa-k1ZC-U110663475217kpG-1968x1216@Diario-Vasco.jpeg\" alt=\"San Roque – Playa de Sotogrande\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1202\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1920px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1920/1202;\" loading=\"lazy\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Playa de Sotogrande is a haven of luxury and exclusivity in the coastal town of San Roque. This pristine beach, backed by lush greenery and a marina, is favoured by those seeking a tranquil retreat amidst stylish surroundings. The beach offers a range of water sports and upscale dining options.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>7. Mijas – Playa de Cala Mijas: A Hidden Gem</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10620 lazyload\" data-src=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/photo2jpg.jpg\" alt=\"Mijas – Playa de Cala Mijas\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" data-srcset=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/photo2jpg.jpg 1200w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/photo2jpg-300x225.jpg 300w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/photo2jpg-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/photo2jpg-768x576.jpg 768w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/photo2jpg-20x15.jpg 20w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/photo2jpg-32x24.jpg 32w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1200px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1200/900;\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Nestled between towering cliffs, Playa de Cala Mijas is a secluded gem accessible only by foot or boat. This charming cove offers a tranquil escape from the crowds, with its crystal-clear waters, soft sand, and picturesque surroundings.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>8.&nbsp;<strong>Torremolinos</strong>&nbsp;–&nbsp;<strong>Playa de la Carihuela: A Taste of Andalusian Traditions</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10621 lazyload\" data-src=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/sld_torremolinos_carihuela_2.jpg\" alt=\"Torremolinos&nbsp;–&nbsp;Playa de la Carihuela\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1200\" data-srcset=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/sld_torremolinos_carihuela_2.jpg 1920w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/sld_torremolinos_carihuela_2-300x188.jpg 300w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/sld_torremolinos_carihuela_2-1024x640.jpg 1024w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/sld_torremolinos_carihuela_2-768x480.jpg 768w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/sld_torremolinos_carihuela_2-20x13.jpg 20w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/sld_torremolinos_carihuela_2-32x20.jpg 32w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/sld_torremolinos_carihuela_2-1536x960.jpg 1536w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1920px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1920/1200;\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Playa de la Carihuela is a vibrant stretch of sand steeped in Andalusian traditions. This popular beach in Torremolinos is renowned for its delicious seafood restaurants, lively atmosphere, and traditional chiringuitos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>9.&nbsp;<strong>Benalmádena</strong>&nbsp;–&nbsp;<strong>Playa de Bil Bil: A Moroccan Oasis</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10622 lazyload\" data-src=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/arc_19323_g.webp\" alt=\"Benalmádena&nbsp;–&nbsp;Playa de Bil Bil\" width=\"1550\" height=\"775\" data-srcset=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/arc_19323_g.webp 1550w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/arc_19323_g-300x150.webp 300w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/arc_19323_g-1024x512.webp 1024w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/arc_19323_g-768x384.webp 768w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/arc_19323_g-20x10.webp 20w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/arc_19323_g-32x16.webp 32w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/arc_19323_g-1536x768.webp 1536w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1550px) 100vw, 1550px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1550px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1550/775;\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Playa de Bil Bil is a unique oasis in Benalmádena, inspired by Moroccan architecture. This picturesque beach features colourful towers and fountains, creating a captivating contrast against the backdrop of the Mediterranean Sea. The beach offers a range of water sports and beachfront dining options.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>10.&nbsp;<strong>Málaga</strong>&nbsp;–&nbsp;<strong>Playa de la Cala del Moral: A Relaxing Retreat</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10623 lazyload\" data-src=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/playa-la-cala-del-moral-desde-el-cantal.jpg\" alt=\"Málaga&nbsp;–&nbsp;Playa de la Cala del Moral\" width=\"550\" height=\"413\" data-srcset=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/playa-la-cala-del-moral-desde-el-cantal.jpg 550w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/playa-la-cala-del-moral-desde-el-cantal-300x225.jpg 300w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/playa-la-cala-del-moral-desde-el-cantal-20x15.jpg 20w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/playa-la-cala-del-moral-desde-el-cantal-32x24.jpg 32w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 550px) 100vw, 550px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 550px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 550/413;\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Playa de la Cala del Moral is a tranquil retreat just a short drive from Málaga city centre. This charming cove offers a peaceful escape from the crowds, with its sheltered waters, soft sand, and picturesque surroundings. The beach is also well-equipped with amenities, including playgrounds, showers, and sun loungers.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Found where you love? Now find the property you love here: www.Propertylist.es</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><br></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><footer class=\"simple_footer\"><div class=\"container custom_container\"><div class=\"row align-items-center\"><div class=\"col-sm-6 text-right\"><ul class=\"list-unstyled f_social_icon\">\n        \n        \n                        </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</footer>\n</div> <!-- Body Wrapper -->\n\n    <a id=\"back-to-top\" title=\"Back to Top\" class=\"right\"></a>\n        <div id=\"reading-progress\"><div id=\"reading-progress-fill\"></div></div>\n    <template id=\"tp-language\" data-tp-language=\"en_GB\"></template><div class=\"trp_model_container\" id=\"trp_ald_modal_container\" style=\"display: none\" data-no-dynamic-translation=\"\" data-no-translation=\"\">\n        <div class=\"trp_ald_modal\" id=\"trp_ald_modal_popup\">\n            <div id=\"trp_ald_popup_text\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"trp_ald_select_and_button\">\n            <div class=\"trp_ald_ls_container\">\n            <div class=\"trp-language-switcher trp-language-switcher-container\" id=\"trp_ald_popup_select_container\" data-no-translation=\"\">\n                \n                <div class=\"trp-ls-shortcode-current-language\" id=\"en_GB\" special-selector=\"trp_ald_popup_current_language\" data-trp-ald-selected-language=\"en_GB\">\n                    <img class=\"trp-flag-image lazy